---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BackLink from "../../components/BackLink.astro";
import { legalEntity } from "../../data/legal";
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	title="Legal notice | Zaviren"
	description="Legal notice for zaviren.com: owner identification, terms of use and intellectual property."
	altHref="/aviso-legal"
>
	<section class="legal">
		<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
		<h1>Legal notice</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>
		<p class="legal-note">
			This is an informational translation. The Spanish version is the
			legally binding one. See <a href="/aviso-legal">Aviso legal</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>1. Identification</h2>
		<p>
			In compliance with Spanish law (Law 34/2002, LSSI-CE, art. 10), the
			owner of this website ({legalEntity.domain}) is <strong>{legalEntity.companyName}</strong>,
			tax ID <strong>{legalEntity.taxId}</strong>, registered address <strong>{legalEntity.address}</strong>.
			{legalEntity.registryInfo}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${legalEntity.contactEmail}`}>{legalEntity.contactEmail}</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>2. Purpose</h2>
		<p>
			This website informs visitors about {legalEntity.companyName}'s
			products and services and lets interested users get in touch through
			the contact forms provided.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Terms of use</h2>
		<p>
			Accessing and using this website makes you a user and implies
			acceptance of the terms in this legal notice. Users agree to make
			appropriate use of the content and services offered and not to use
			them for unlawful purposes or in bad faith.
		</p>

		<h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
		<p>
			The content of this website (text, design, trademarks, logos and
			other elements) belongs to {legalEntity.companyName} or third
			parties who have authorized its use, and is protected by
			intellectual and industrial property law. Reproduction, distribution
			or modification without prior authorization is prohibited.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
		<p>
			This site may contain links to third-party websites. {legalEntity.companyName} is not responsible for the content or
			privacy practices of those sites, which are outside our control.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Disclaimer</h2>
		<p>
			{legalEntity.companyName} does not guarantee the availability or
			continuity of the website and is not liable for damages arising from
			unavailability or access failures, without prejudice to the
			reasonable measures it takes to prevent them.
		</p>

		<h2>7. Governing law</h2>
		<p>
			These terms are governed by Spanish law. Any dispute arising from
			access to or use of this website will be subject to the courts of
			the owner's registered address, unless consumer-protection rules
			establish otherwise.
		</p>

		<h2>8. Changes</h2>
		<p>
			{legalEntity.companyName} may amend this legal notice to reflect
			legislative changes or changes to the website. Please review this
			page periodically.
		</p>

		<BackLink lang="en" />
	</section>
</Layout>
